<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Expert</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>change expert
</pre>
<p><b>change expert</b> switches <b>info</b> at your teachers between the simple list and the expert list; type it again to switch back.
</p><p>The expert list shows everything the teacher teaches you, also what is expensive, and for each line:
</p>
<pre>  32% dagger               [ 32% of 105%, points  8, 12 cp] *
</pre>
<ul><li><b>32%</b>: how good you are now.</li>
<li><b>of 105%</b>: your potential, the most you can ever reach in it. It comes from your race and profession; for some things it is 0, and you can't learn them at all.</li>
<li><b>points 8</b>: what your next practice costs in practice points.</li>
<li><b>12 cp</b>: what it costs in money. Practice is free up to level 25.</li>
<li>Each <b>*</b>: once practiced already this level; the next practice costs half as much again.</li></ul>
<p>Expensive lines (20 points or more) are shown greyed out.
</p><p><br />
See also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Info</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Change</a>
</pre>




</div>